.TP
.B #{client_prefix}
1 while the client has pressed the prefix key and not yet the key after it, else 0; the status line
redraws when it changes.
The bar is drawn once per session, so with several clients attached it is 1 if any of them is
waiting for the key after the prefix
.TP
